WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:01.820
- I want us to head west and

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:02.640
never stop.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:04.540
You in?

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.000
- I'm in baby.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.080
- Let's get it.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.420
- So you just want to listen to the music all the time?

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:15.580
- I want you to stay.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.680
- How well do you know James?

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.100
- Enough to say I love him.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:26.960
- You look like you need saving.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.800
- I screwed up.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.000
- I was just trying to be like you.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.180
- I want you to be better.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:36.780
- Shall we?

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.180
- You need to stop carrying the weight of the world

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.260
on your shoulders.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.560
(Child Inaudible)

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.420
- I saw something.

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:05.660
- They said the age of heros will never come again

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:09.740
- The rich and the powerful

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.440
they don't care about us.

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.160
- Now I don't think I need to give you this

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:15.620
(Inaudible) when you say no .

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:16.860
- Don't mess with me

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:18.340
Cause I will kill you,

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:19.900
And everybody you love.

